    56	\title{Colouring Graphs of Bounded Diameter in the Absence of Small Cycles\thanks{Research supported by the Leverhulme Trust (RPG-2016-258). An extended abstract~\cite{MPS21} of the paper will appear in the proceedings of CIAC 2021.}}
