"""Verified Track-B generator from arXiv:2108.06115.

Bonduelle and Kardos use a non-crossing perfect quasi-matching in an
auxiliary pseudograph to encode the possible positions of Kempe chains
(Definitions 2.4--2.6).  Section 3 says that their checker polynomially
reduces this problem to CNF-SAT.

