cyclic order, allowed chords may cross, and the answer is a perfect matching
whose selected chords do not cross.  Complete reflection matchings are
sampled first; regular crossing shift-matchings are superposed as traps, so a
certificate is known by inverse generation.  The generic reference algorithm
