The first adversarial run caught a real planting weakness: an 8-restart WalkSAT-style local search solved all 8 shipping seeds. I’m treating that as a failed family version, not a passing gate. I’m replacing that probe only after changing the construction or attack definition in a way that preserves an honest in-context threat model; the successful algorithm will remain disclosed if it continues to solve.
