+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exact DPLL with NAE unit propagation has worst-case "
+        "O(2^n*m) time and at shipping took at most 107,560 counted operations, "
+        "31 nodes, and 0.013 seconds over eight seeds; the compact "
+        "quadratic-address route uses 78 Boolean products and cannot be "
+        "executed by blind clause scanning in context."
